efault":false,"description":"Yugabyte SQL (YSQL)"},{"id":1419821900,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNDE5ODIxOTAw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/priority/medium","name":"priority/medium","color":"ffdc5e","default":false,"description":"Medium priority issue"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":{"login":"myang2021","id":79478033,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5NDc4MDMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79478033?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021","html_url":"https://github.com/myang2021","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"myang2021","id":79478033,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5NDc4MDMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79478033?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021","html_url":"https://github.com/myang2021","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myang2021/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-01-08T18:01:20Z","updated_at":"2025-04-03T22:51:39Z","closed_at":"2025-04-03T22:51:39Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-14796](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-14796)\r\n### Description\r\n\r\n[PG13](https://www.postgresql.org/docs/13/sql-createdatabase.html) [introduced](https://git.postgresql.org/gitweb/?p=postgresql.git;a=commitdiff;h=06140c201) the option of [locale](https://www.postgresql.org/docs/15/locale.html) in create database. \r\n\r\n```\r\nlocale\r\nThis is a shortcut for setting LC_COLLATE and LC_CTYPE at once. If you specify this, you cannot specify either of those parameters.\r\n```\r\n\r\nCurrently up to 2024.2 we only support  `C` in `lc_collate` option.\r\n```\r\nCREATE DATABASE music lc_collate 'POSIX' TEMPLATE template0;\r\nERROR:  Value other than 'C' for lc_collate option is not yet supported\r\nLINE 1: CREATE DATABASE music5 lc_collate 'POSIX' TEMPLATE template0...\r\n```\r\n\r\nThough in 2.25.0 (latest Master) : we allow `POSIX` and possibly other values for LOCALE option. \r\n```\r\n172.151.20.101:5433 yugabyte@yugabyte=# CREATE DATABASE music3 LOCALE 'POSIX' TEMPLATE template0;\r\nCREATE DATABASE\r\nTime: 599.035 ms\r\n```\r\nIdeally `locale` should be limited to 'C'  and this is new option is new in YB-PG15 so likely requires similar blocker as done for collate option : https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/blob/fc3a146cb1dc78f775bc4e12c5a8ec1847a63ae4/src/postgres/src/backend/commands/dbcommands.c#L1056\r\nAlso evaluate if that restriction can be relaxed to include any other collocations e.g ICU collocations.\r\n\r\n\r\n================================================================================\r\nPostgreSQL12  added the support for non-deterministic collation which should also be blocked in YB as that is currently not supported.\r\n\r\n\r\n### Issue Type\r\n\r\nkind/bug\r\n\r\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\r\n\r\n- [X] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\r\n\r\n[DB-14796]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-14796?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","closed_by":{"login":"sushantrmishra","id":7229015,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjkwMTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7229015?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra","html_url":"https://github.com/sushantrmishra","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/25541/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/25541/timeline","performed_via_github